WEBVTT

00:10:26.329 --> 00:10:31.162
But it also seems like vulnerability
is easier for women to process

00:10:31.162 --> 00:10:34.829
and maybe adopt. And it's something
men struggle a lot more with.

00:10:34.829 --> 00:10:37.537
And I wondered if you could talk about
what you found in your research there

00:10:37.537 --> 00:10:41.746
and a little bit of the psychology of why
men struggle so much with vulnerability.

00:10:42.121 --> 00:10:43.662
I have moved from talking about men

00:10:43.662 --> 00:10:46.954
and women just to talking about
folks who are, you know,

00:10:46.954 --> 00:10:48.662
trying to meet masculine norms

00:10:48.662 --> 00:10:51.496
and folks trying to meet feminine
norms just to be more inclusive.

00:10:51.537 --> 00:10:56.496
But here's the thing. In terms
of masculine norms,

00:10:56.496 --> 00:11:01.121
the biggest shame trigger is do
not be perceived as weak.